(5649310, 820245, 36065, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but I do suspect that I will see several similar images.  Nice composition and lighting, but I''d like a bit deeper depth of field.  The two presentations of 9 is nicely creative.  This one I will go 6.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but I do suspect that I will see several similar images.  Nice composition and lighting, but I''d like a bit deeper depth of field.  The two presentations of 9 is nicely creative.  This one I will go 6.', '2009-09-16 05:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649311, 821477, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but there is just something missing in the presentation.  I think that you have lost too much detail in too many areas of the image.  The white of the plate seems bright and blown while the deep darks appear underexposed.  This one leaves my mind''s eye longing to see more of what was there, thus passing along an uncomfortable feeling.  5.</td>', 'I like the idea, but there is just something missing in the presentation.  I think that you have lost too much detail in too many areas of the image.  The white of the plate seems bright and blown while the deep darks appear underexposed.  This one leaves my mind''s eye longing to see more of what was there, thus passing along an uncomfortable feeling.  5.', '2009-09-16 05:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649320, 821228, 36065, '<td valign="top">Ha! Looks a lot like my freaking college days.  I couldn''t keep a darn thing organized, to do lists or not.  The tones here seem a bit flat to me.  I think some added contrast would help this one a great deal.  A simple curves adjustment and a nice, clean border would have added a good deal of depth and drama to this capture.  This is how I envisioned it after my first look at it:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=821670" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821670.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821670.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821670.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Even still, I like the still life idea and the cluttered composition.  This one gets a 6.</td>', 'Ha! Looks a lot like my freaking college days.  I couldn''t keep a darn thing organized, to do lists or not.  The tones here seem a bit flat to me.  I think some added contrast would help this one a great deal.  A simple curves adjustment and a nice, clean border would have added a good deal of depth and drama to this capture.  This is how I envisioned it after my first look at it:   Even still, I like the still life idea and the cluttered composition.  This one gets a 6.', '2009-09-16 05:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649327, 821590, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  I do, however, think that I''d like to see it a little more high-key.  The shadows on your whites do provide the image with a bit of depth, but I think them to be more of a distraction than an integral addition to the scene.  Also, the gray border feels out of place.  I do like borders, I just don''t like the gray.  6.</td>', 'Nice macro.  I do, however, think that I''d like to see it a little more high-key.  The shadows on your whites do provide the image with a bit of depth, but I think them to be more of a distraction than an integral addition to the scene.  Also, the gray border feels out of place.  I do like borders, I just don''t like the gray.  6.', '2009-09-16 05:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649328, 821446, 109414, '<td valign="top">did u really just post a picture of "666" and not let it phase u?  i was afraid i would see a photo like this, otherwise a great shot!!</td>', 'did u really just post a picture of "666" and not let it phase u?  i was afraid i would see a photo like this, otherwise a great shot!!', '2009-09-16 05:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649331, 820765, 36065, '<td valign="top">Not a bad plan, but the lighting is far too harsh, uneven and unbalanced for this one.  My eye is immediately drawn to the several hot spots in the image and captured there.  4.</td>', 'Not a bad plan, but the lighting is far too harsh, uneven and unbalanced for this one.  My eye is immediately drawn to the several hot spots in the image and captured there.  4.', '2009-09-16 05:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649334, 821397, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but it is a far too common subject to draw a high score.  The reflection and angles in your subject absolutely serve well to add interest, but it is still just dice on a dull, reflective surface.  4.</td>', 'Nice composition, but it is a far too common subject to draw a high score.  The reflection and angles in your subject absolutely serve well to add interest, but it is still just dice on a dull, reflective surface.  4.', '2009-09-16 05:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649335, 821417, 36065, '<td valign="top">For this one to draw high numbers, I think you''d need crisp focus throughout the entire image.  The objects in the back of the image seem to fade into softness and loss of detail.  Interesting subjects, but I thin a little more exposure would help give this one some pop as well.  5.</td>', 'For this one to draw high numbers, I think you''d need crisp focus throughout the entire image.  The objects in the back of the image seem to fade into softness and loss of detail.  Interesting subjects, but I thin a little more exposure would help give this one some pop as well.  5.', '2009-09-16 05:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649336, 821475, 98912, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for me.</td>', 'A little too dark for me.', '2009-09-16 05:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
