(5649406, 821555, 36065, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this one would have been completely lost on me.  The uneven crop feels awkward and there are some odd color casts and gradients all around the letter.  2.</td>', 'Without the title, this one would have been completely lost on me.  The uneven crop feels awkward and there are some odd color casts and gradients all around the letter.  2.', '2009-09-16 05:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649407, 821548, 36065, '<td valign="top">I definitely do not understand your title.  The colors you captured are true and appealing to my eye, but the frame feels very, very jumbled.  3.</td>', 'I definitely do not understand your title.  The colors you captured are true and appealing to my eye, but the frame feels very, very jumbled.  3.', '2009-09-16 05:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649408, 821324, 36065, '<td valign="top">A seemingly common subject for this challenge.  It took some time of searching through the busy frame to find the actual subject of the challenge.  While the idea works for the challenge, this one needs to be tighter on the subject.  4.</td>', 'A seemingly common subject for this challenge.  It took some time of searching through the busy frame to find the actual subject of the challenge.  While the idea works for the challenge, this one needs to be tighter on the subject.  4.', '2009-09-16 05:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649409, 821386, 104841, '<td valign="top">Nice mono conversion. I feel that the shot would have been better if the cat was either looking at the camera or had more interaction with the nine. I know easier said then done.</td>', 'Nice mono conversion. I feel that the shot would have been better if the cat was either looking at the camera or had more interaction with the nine. I know easier said then done.', '2009-09-16 05:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649412, 821266, 36065, '<td valign="top">A different and composition would serve this capture a good deal better.  The high key background works with the subject(s), but the shallow depth of field detracts from the overall appeal of the image.  I feel like the subject is 9 little candies, so there should be 9 little candies in crisp focus.  Also, the chopping crop on the right hand side seems more accidental than composed.  I''d like to see this one executed better.  3.</td>', 'A different and composition would serve this capture a good deal better.  The high key background works with the subject(s), but the shallow depth of field detracts from the overall appeal of the image.  I feel like the subject is 9 little candies, so there should be 9 little candies in crisp focus.  Also, the chopping crop on the right hand side seems more accidental than composed.  I''d like to see this one executed better.  3.', '2009-09-16 05:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649414, 820635, 104841, '<td valign="top">wow great location. You must have been annoyed with that bird that decided to paddle though the reflections. Shot would have been better at high tide and with some more sky interest. otherwise nice shot</td>', 'wow great location. You must have been annoyed with that bird that decided to paddle though the reflections. Shot would have been better at high tide and with some more sky interest. otherwise nice shot', '2009-09-16 05:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649415, 821554, 36065, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea beginning, but the image is lacking interest and draw.  For a macro, it is nice.  I like the detail you captured in the typed numbers, as well as the paper itself.  The tilt seems so slight that it was more accidental than composition, and the overall crop feels tense and awkward.  4.</td>', 'Not a bad idea beginning, but the image is lacking interest and draw.  For a macro, it is nice.  I like the detail you captured in the typed numbers, as well as the paper itself.  The tilt seems so slight that it was more accidental than composition, and the overall crop feels tense and awkward.  4.', '2009-09-16 05:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649417, 821459, 36065, '<td valign="top">I get that its a 9 iron, but at first glance, I see a 6.  I like the deep black you capture in your background to make your subject pop, but the ball needs to be a bigger part of the frame and better lit.  Good start, but it could definitely use more time in the setup and lighting.  5.</td>', 'I get that its a 9 iron, but at first glance, I see a 6.  I like the deep black you capture in your background to make your subject pop, but the ball needs to be a bigger part of the frame and better lit.  Good start, but it could definitely use more time in the setup and lighting.  5.', '2009-09-16 06:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649420, 821229, 36065, '<td valign="top">I really had to search for the overall relation to the challenge subject.  This is a neat image, but it is a shoehorn entry into the challenge.  Nice technicals, but this one would better serve you in a different challenge.  3.</td>', 'I really had to search for the overall relation to the challenge subject.  This is a neat image, but it is a shoehorn entry into the challenge.  Nice technicals, but this one would better serve you in a different challenge.  3.', '2009-09-16 06:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649421, 821143, 104841, '<td valign="top">Really nice close up, but I don''t see the connection to the challenge.</td>', 'Really nice close up, but I don''t see the connection to the challenge.', '2009-09-16 06:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649422, 821336, 36065, '<td valign="top">The challenge subject is 9.  Here I see a 69.  It also feels like a simple snapshot that required very little thought.  The composition needs a lot of work, and the lighting is very uneven. It is possible to give simple, everyday subjects great interest and drama as they are turned into an image, but this one falls short.  2.</td>', 'The challenge subject is 9.  Here I see a 69.  It also feels like a simple snapshot that required very little thought.  The composition needs a lot of work, and the lighting is very uneven. It is possible to give simple, everyday subjects great interest and drama as they are turned into an image, but this one falls short.  2.', '2009-09-16 06:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649423, 821603, 104841, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the wood, what is that bird on the left doing? It just looks weird.</td>', 'Nice detail in the wood, what is that bird on the left doing? It just looks weird.', '2009-09-16 06:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649424, 821244, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the depth of field feels too shallow for this particular capture.  It looks like the back matchsticks are falling off into softness.  In my opinion, of you are using nine objects in a challenge that is titled Nine, all nine subjects should be in crisp focus.  I like the composition.  5.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the depth of field feels too shallow for this particular capture.  It looks like the back matchsticks are falling off into softness.  In my opinion, of you are using nine objects in a challenge that is titled Nine, all nine subjects should be in crisp focus.  I like the composition.  5.', '2009-09-16 06:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649425, 821482, 36065, '<td valign="top">Clever titling, but the 9s fall off into the comparatively huge frame.  4.</td>', 'Clever titling, but the 9s fall off into the comparatively huge frame.  4.', '2009-09-16 06:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649427, 821626, 104841, '<td valign="top">really nice macro shot, maybe a touch blown out in the top left.  The only down side is that i don''t think its relevant to the challenge.</td>', 'really nice macro shot, maybe a touch blown out in the top left.  The only down side is that i don''t think its relevant to the challenge.', '2009-09-16 06:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649430, 820718, 104841, '<td valign="top">Really like the gnomes. Would have liked to more if they were out in the garden though.</td>', 'Really like the gnomes. Would have liked to more if they were out in the garden though.', '2009-09-16 06:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649431, 820451, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  I have a soft spot for well done street photography, and I like the way this one fits into the challenge.  There are many, many areas of interest that keep my eye moving, all the while holding it inside the frame save the one lady on the end of the leading line on the right side.  Even still, my eye likes this one, but the tones are flat.  There are some true whites, but the blacks are definitely missing.  With a simple contrast of curves adjustment, this one would portray a great deal more drama.  Here is the adjustment I would have made:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=821672" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821672.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821672.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821672.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>That is with a simple, 30 second curves layer added to the entire image.  Even still, I like what you have seen and captured here.  I am voting this one a 7, but with a few slight adjustments this one would have crawled even higher for me.  Nice capture.</td>', 'I like this image.  I have a soft spot for well done street photography, and I like the way this one fits into the challenge.  There are many, many areas of interest that keep my eye moving, all the while holding it inside the frame save the one lady on the end of the leading line on the right side.  Even still, my eye likes this one, but the tones are flat.  There are some true whites, but the blacks are definitely missing.  With a simple contrast of curves adjustment, this one would portray a great deal more drama.  Here is the adjustment I would have made:   That is with a simple, 30 second curves layer added to the entire image.  Even still, I like what you have seen and captured here.  I am voting this one a 7, but with a few slight adjustments this one would have crawled even higher for me.  Nice capture.', '2009-09-16 06:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649433, 821429, 104841, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what you are trying to do here and how its related to the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t understand what you are trying to do here and how its related to the challenge.', '2009-09-16 06:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649434, 821557, 36065, '<td valign="top">Always, always, always use the full resolution and image size that DPC allows in any given challenge.  640 px is very small on most monitors by today''s standards.  Yours is just over half of the allowed resolution.  Also, the hot spot there by the 9 is distracting.  1.</td>', 'Always, always, always use the full resolution and image size that DPC allows in any given challenge.  640 px is very small on most monitors by today''s standards.  Yours is just over half of the allowed resolution.  Also, the hot spot there by the 9 is distracting.  1.', '2009-09-16 06:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649436, 820635, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the serenity of the scene.  It makes me feel like autumn is approaching.  I would like to see the water even more still, if that''s even possible to capture.  Nice, peaceful scene.  I''d lie to see this one at a larger resolution to really enjoy the detail.  6.</td>', 'I like the serenity of the scene.  It makes me feel like autumn is approaching.  I would like to see the water even more still, if that''s even possible to capture.  Nice, peaceful scene.  I''d lie to see this one at a larger resolution to really enjoy the detail.  6.', '2009-09-16 06:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649437, 821124, 104841, '<td valign="top">Really subtle reference to the challenge. If this was the first cat pic I looked at I would not have seen the connection. At least they make the connection in the photo title. Other wise I like the feel of the shot.</td>', 'Really subtle reference to the challenge. If this was the first cat pic I looked at I would not have seen the connection. At least they make the connection in the photo title. Other wise I like the feel of the shot.', '2009-09-16 06:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649439, 821550, 36065, '<td valign="top">Awesome tonal range with such a small, minimalistic presentation.  That second petal on the left is a bit blown, this providing a small distraction and trap for my wandering eye.  I like the composition, but that spot near the top on the right is driving me nuts.  I keep trying to clean my monitor.  Even still, nice capture and a strong presentation.  7.</td>', 'Awesome tonal range with such a small, minimalistic presentation.  That second petal on the left is a bit blown, this providing a small distraction and trap for my wandering eye.  I like the composition, but that spot near the top on the right is driving me nuts.  I keep trying to clean my monitor.  Even still, nice capture and a strong presentation.  7.', '2009-09-16 06:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649440, 821429, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nothing is focused and the composition is far from appealing.  1.</td>', 'Nothing is focused and the composition is far from appealing.  1.', '2009-09-16 06:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649441, 821528, 50578, '<td valign="top">That really depends on the mom and the pregnancy. However I get your point. Because the following 18 years are not peaceful to say the least. Nice lighting in this shot.   Do you know, is it a boy or a girl?</td>', 'That really depends on the mom and the pregnancy. However I get your point. Because the following 18 years are not peaceful to say the least. Nice lighting in this shot.   Do you know, is it a boy or a girl?', '2009-09-16 06:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649444, 821598, 36065, '<td valign="top">Lose that flash!  The image itself has potential, but billiard balls are tough to shoot.  This is especially true when shooting with the small, harsh, on-camera flash unit.  There is a bright spot of distraction on every ball.  This makes it difficult for my eye to appreciate the image.  4.</td>', 'Lose that flash!  The image itself has potential, but billiard balls are tough to shoot.  This is especially true when shooting with the small, harsh, on-camera flash unit.  There is a bright spot of distraction on every ball.  This makes it difficult for my eye to appreciate the image.  4.', '2009-09-16 06:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649445, 821011, 104841, '<td valign="top">Second pregnant lady I have seen in this challenge. I liked the other one over yours mainly because of the white top. Here it just looks blown with no tonal variation.</td>', 'Second pregnant lady I have seen in this challenge. I liked the other one over yours mainly because of the white top. Here it just looks blown with no tonal variation.', '2009-09-16 06:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649447, 821467, 36065, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, but I like the abstract presentation.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  I appreciate the originality that you presented to the voters and viewers.  This is one of my favorites in this challenge right now.  8.  Now what the hell is it?</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, but I like the abstract presentation.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  I appreciate the originality that you presented to the voters and viewers.  This is one of my favorites in this challenge right now.  8.  Now what the hell is it?', '2009-09-16 06:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649448, 820718, 36065, '<td valign="top">That''s a lot of garden gnomes.  Interesting choice of subjects, but the environment surround them leaves a lot to be desired.  I picture these guys set up out in the garden with a background and surroundings of great interest.  Shot like this, it just seems like a snapshot of clutter.  I''d really like to see this one taken with an interesting environment for my eye to roam and explore.  4.</td>', 'That''s a lot of garden gnomes.  Interesting choice of subjects, but the environment surround them leaves a lot to be desired.  I picture these guys set up out in the garden with a background and surroundings of great interest.  Shot like this, it just seems like a snapshot of clutter.  I''d really like to see this one taken with an interesting environment for my eye to roam and explore.  4.', '2009-09-16 06:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649450, 821387, 104841, '<td valign="top">Have a look at some of the other cat photos in the challenge in particular the composition (what is the cat doing) and the back ground.</td>', 'Have a look at some of the other cat photos in the challenge in particular the composition (what is the cat doing) and the back ground.', '2009-09-16 06:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649454, 821570, 104841, '<td valign="top">Fits right into the challenge, but the flash here is really harsh. Either turn down the flash(if you can) or use some off camera lighting.</td>', 'Fits right into the challenge, but the flash here is really harsh. Either turn down the flash(if you can) or use some off camera lighting.', '2009-09-16 06:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649455, 821127, 36065, '<td valign="top">You have an awesome, awesome start here, but you left it too flat and gray. A duotone image should include tones from both ends of the range, as well as most of the tones in between.  This is exactly the type of subject that I wanted to shoot for this challenge, but I was far too busy this week to go hunting for it.  The only thing you are lacking is contrast, thus missing the dramatic feeling that grabs the viewer''s eye.  Here would have been my editing take on the same subject:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=821674" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821674.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821674.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36065/120/821674.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>While I usually try to leave some amount of detail in the shadows, the surround wall contains enough detail that I would like to see that shadow black.  Well seen and well composed.  A little more drama would have surely grown your vote.  6.</td>', 'You have an awesome, awesome start here, but you left it too flat and gray. A duotone image should include tones from both ends of the range, as well as most of the tones in between.  This is exactly the type of subject that I wanted to shoot for this challenge, but I was far too busy this week to go hunting for it.  The only thing you are lacking is contrast, thus missing the dramatic feeling that grabs the viewer''s eye.  Here would have been my editing take on the same subject:   While I usually try to leave some amount of detail in the shadows, the surround wall contains enough detail that I would like to see that shadow black.  Well seen and well composed.  A little more drama would have surely grown your vote.  6.', '2009-09-16 06:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649457, 821229, 104841, '<td valign="top">Must have gotten up early for this shot. Took my a while to find out where the nine was though.</td>', 'Must have gotten up early for this shot. Took my a while to find out where the nine was though.', '2009-09-16 06:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649458, 821270, 36065, '<td valign="top">You chose a very difficult, almost impossible, subject to effectively photograph.  With the fuzzy buds, it is very difficult for my eye to find your primary area(s) of focus.  I think trying to capture a single bud would be a challenge, but trying to capture 9 is overwhelming.  4.</td>', 'You chose a very difficult, almost impossible, subject to effectively photograph.  With the fuzzy buds, it is very difficult for my eye to find your primary area(s) of focus.  I think trying to capture a single bud would be a challenge, but trying to capture 9 is overwhelming.  4.', '2009-09-16 06:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649459, 821125, 36065, '<td valign="top">The two bubble on the top  right seem soft to me.  4.</td>', 'The two bubble on the top  right seem soft to me.  4.', '2009-09-16 06:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649460, 821479, 36065, '<td valign="top">While very and very commonplace, I like what you have composed here.  Your angles and point of view adds great depth and interest to the image while your contrast adds drama to such a simple subject.  Well seen and well captured.   7.</td>', 'While very and very commonplace, I like what you have composed here.  Your angles and point of view adds great depth and interest to the image while your contrast adds drama to such a simple subject.  Well seen and well captured.   7.', '2009-09-16 06:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649461, 821461, 36065, '<td valign="top">I need focus and the top left corner is distracting.  3.</td>', 'I need focus and the top left corner is distracting.  3.', '2009-09-16 06:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5649465, 821385, 36065, '<td valign="top">But I see ten of them.  4.</td>', 'But I see ten of them.  4.', '2009-09-16 06:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
