(5650113, 821219, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great Macro .. there are bunch of clothespin, but this one is done really well - its my pick for the highest amongst all the clothespin! - 7</td>', 'Great Macro .. there are bunch of clothespin, but this one is done really well - its my pick for the highest amongst all the clothespin! - 7', '2009-09-16 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650115, 820451, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great perspective ..  Whites seem a little more exposed - could be just my monitor ..Just need a tad bit more contrast.. a play with levels and curves would have really brought this image out and made my vote change from a 7 to 8 or 9!</td>', 'Great perspective ..  Whites seem a little more exposed - could be just my monitor ..Just need a tad bit more contrast.. a play with levels and curves would have really brought this image out and made my vote change from a 7 to 8 or 9!', '2009-09-16 16:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650117, 820803, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think it would be stronger with a deeper dof. I like the subtle reflections.</td>', 'I think it would be stronger with a deeper dof. I like the subtle reflections.', '2009-09-16 16:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650119, 821106, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think the horizon in the background detracts from the shot - also it might have given your subject more impact to shoot from a higher angle. <br/> <br/>I like the white on white and the strong side lighting.</td>', 'I think the horizon in the background detracts from the shot - also it might have given your subject more impact to shoot from a higher angle.  I like the white on white and the strong side lighting.', '2009-09-16 16:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650123, 821266, 3554, '<td valign="top">I find the chocolate dust to be distracting in this kind of close up shot.<br/> <br/>I like the general idea and much of the setup. The lighter chocolate in front seems to be your main subject - try laying it on it''s side to distinguish it from the others and giving us a chance to see the design on top. I''d also try moving the dark chocolate on the right of the main subject slightly further back so it''s not competing with the focus of your shot as much.</td>', 'I find the chocolate dust to be distracting in this kind of close up shot. I like the general idea and much of the setup. The lighter chocolate in front seems to be your main subject - try laying it on it''s side to distinguish it from the others and giving us a chance to see the design on top. I''d also try moving the dark chocolate on the right of the main subject slightly further back so it''s not competing with the focus of your shot as much.', '2009-09-16 16:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650125, 821476, 42256, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and great work with the reflections..scuffs on the top right of the watch are bothering me a little bit but i guess I am just being picky! One of the better watch shots in the challenge! would have loved seeing 9:00:09 or 9:00 ..but 9:00:29 will work too - 7</td>', 'Nice capture and great work with the reflections..scuffs on the top right of the watch are bothering me a little bit but i guess I am just being picky! One of the better watch shots in the challenge! would have loved seeing 9:00:09 or 9:00 ..but 9:00:29 will work too - 7', '2009-09-16 16:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650127, 820342, 3554, '<td valign="top">This shot just doesn''t quite work for me - it seems too cluttered and for some reason the word "dirty" keeps coming to mind. There''s no good resting place for my eye and I spend too much time trying to make sense of the photo.<br/> <br/>I like that you did something creative.</td>', 'This shot just doesn''t quite work for me - it seems too cluttered and for some reason the word "dirty" keeps coming to mind. There''s no good resting place for my eye and I spend too much time trying to make sense of the photo. I like that you did something creative.', '2009-09-16 16:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650129, 820517, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think the half of the photo from the cue ball back to the player is fairly strong. I like that the player is in the shadows and I like the ghost of the cue ball. <br/> <br/>The glaring lighting from the over head lights kills this one for me though. Indoor lighting can be a pain but play with the lighting more and I think you''d have a stronger shot.</td>', 'I think the half of the photo from the cue ball back to the player is fairly strong. I like that the player is in the shadows and I like the ghost of the cue ball.  The glaring lighting from the over head lights kills this one for me though. Indoor lighting can be a pain but play with the lighting more and I think you''d have a stronger shot.', '2009-09-16 16:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650135, 821417, 3554, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on it but the subject of this shot is unappealing to me. Something about the color cast puts me off.<br/> <br/>I like the reflections underneath and I like that the one in front has the light reflecting from it. If the other one in the same row (far left) didn''t also have a lighter hue to it I think it would have made the front drop stand out and that might have been more interesting.<br/> <br/>I think the frame helps this kind of shot and like it here.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on it but the subject of this shot is unappealing to me. Something about the color cast puts me off. I like the reflections underneath and I like that the one in front has the light reflecting from it. If the other one in the same row (far left) didn''t also have a lighter hue to it I think it would have made the front drop stand out and that might have been more interesting. I think the frame helps this kind of shot and like it here.', '2009-09-16 16:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650137, 820866, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on the daisies! They seem a bit out of focus though, I don''t quite understand the significance of the jeans background! But overall something about the shot just makes it work well! It could be the symmetry of the stitching on the jeans or the way flowers are placed! - 7</td>', 'Great lighting on the daisies! They seem a bit out of focus though, I don''t quite understand the significance of the jeans background! But overall something about the shot just makes it work well! It could be the symmetry of the stitching on the jeans or the way flowers are placed! - 7', '2009-09-16 16:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650141, 821447, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of having one stand out from the other with a bite out of it. I think the bite is the main subject and unfortunately it gets lost with the background. <br/> <br/>Perhaps if you widened the angle of the shot and lay the single cookie down flat next to the stack on the white background it would have isolated your main subject more.<br/> <br/>I like that you used side lighting to give the stack definition.</td>', 'I like the idea of having one stand out from the other with a bite out of it. I think the bite is the main subject and unfortunately it gets lost with the background.  Perhaps if you widened the angle of the shot and lay the single cookie down flat next to the stack on the white background it would have isolated your main subject more. I like that you used side lighting to give the stack definition.', '2009-09-16 16:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650142, 821601, 3554, '<td valign="top">Seems I''ve seen something like this before. Whatever is to the right of the "I" is really distracting, if that thing wasn''t there it''d be a lot stronger shot I think. It also seems like it needs a bit of clockwise rotation. I like the gradiated colors of the sky.</td>', 'Seems I''ve seen something like this before. Whatever is to the right of the "I" is really distracting, if that thing wasn''t there it''d be a lot stronger shot I think. It also seems like it needs a bit of clockwise rotation. I like the gradiated colors of the sky.', '2009-09-16 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650143, 821423, 42256, '<td valign="top">I am hungry again! Must have required a really stable hand! Great lighting..texture of the table draws your eye to the bowl! <br/>I have a question - while drawing the 9 if you had messed up would you have started all over again - i.e. either drinking on throwing away this full bowl of milk and ceral? - 7 for the effort!</td>', 'I am hungry again! Must have required a really stable hand! Great lighting..texture of the table draws your eye to the bowl! I have a question - while drawing the 9 if you had messed up would you have started all over again - i.e. either drinking on throwing away this full bowl of milk and ceral? - 7 for the effort!', '2009-09-16 16:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650144, 821566, 3554, '<td valign="top">I feel like I don''t have enough context to understand the story this picture is trying to tell.</td>', 'I feel like I don''t have enough context to understand the story this picture is trying to tell.', '2009-09-16 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650148, 821563, 3554, '<td valign="top">The house and flag in the background seem to overshadow the 9 chairs. A shallower focus or higher angle on the chairs (shooting more down at them from a step ladder maybe) might have helped isolate them more. <br/> <br/>As it is now my eye is always drawn to the flag and the main subjects are an afterthought.</td>', 'The house and flag in the background seem to overshadow the 9 chairs. A shallower focus or higher angle on the chairs (shooting more down at them from a step ladder maybe) might have helped isolate them more.  As it is now my eye is always drawn to the flag and the main subjects are an afterthought.', '2009-09-16 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650150, 821460, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection. The color/lighting doesn''t quite work for me though - just too washed out.</td>', 'I like the reflection. The color/lighting doesn''t quite work for me though - just too washed out.', '2009-09-16 17:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650158, 821610, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think if you had isolated the sign a bit more it would have helped. As it is the sign seems to flat against the background and also seems slightly out of focus.<br/> <br/>I like the general idea and it definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'I think if you had isolated the sign a bit more it would have helped. As it is the sign seems to flat against the background and also seems slightly out of focus. I like the general idea and it definitely meets the challenge.', '2009-09-16 17:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650160, 820773, 42256, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge :  3/3<br/>Execution : 2/2<br/>Originality : 1/2<br/>and everything else : 1/3<br/>total : 7/10<br/> <br/>Great lighting, don''t know what the speck is on the left hand side but its distracting!</td>', 'Meets the challenge :  3/3Execution : 2/2Originality : 1/2and everything else : 1/3total : 7/10 Great lighting, don''t know what the speck is on the left hand side but its distracting!', '2009-09-16 17:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650163, 821143, 3554, '<td valign="top">I keep looking for the shape of a nine in the eye but just don''t see it - if it''s just a play on words its too much of a stretch for me to say it really meets the spirit of the challenge.<br/> <br/>From a technical standpoint I like the focus on the eye but you seem to have a lot of digital noise (over sharpening maybe?) that is distracting.</td>', 'I keep looking for the shape of a nine in the eye but just don''t see it - if it''s just a play on words its too much of a stretch for me to say it really meets the spirit of the challenge. From a technical standpoint I like the focus on the eye but you seem to have a lot of digital noise (over sharpening maybe?) that is distracting.', '2009-09-16 17:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650167, 821399, 42256, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge :  3/3<br/>Execution : 2/2<br/>Originality : 1/2<br/>and everything else : 1/3<br/>total : 7/10<br/> <br/>Serene .. B&amp;W really works well for this shot!</td>', 'Meets the challenge :  3/3Execution : 2/2Originality : 1/2and everything else : 1/3total : 7/10 Serene .. B&W really works well for this shot!', '2009-09-16 17:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650168, 821544, 3554, '<td valign="top">I tend to like subtle pictures but this one doesn''t quite work for me. I find the glare to be distracting and awkwardly placed. If it were on the 9 itself it might work more.<br/> <br/>I like the orange cast on the right side - perhaps more of that all along the right side would have improved the shot.</td>', 'I tend to like subtle pictures but this one doesn''t quite work for me. I find the glare to be distracting and awkwardly placed. If it were on the 9 itself it might work more. I like the orange cast on the right side - perhaps more of that all along the right side would have improved the shot.', '2009-09-16 17:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650172, 821612, 74911, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture... If my guess is right, this must be Maceo Montez, the lightning expert. Very clever way to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Amazing capture... If my guess is right, this must be Maceo Montez, the lightning expert. Very clever way to meet the challenge.', '2009-09-16 17:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650174, 821399, 74911, '<td valign="top">I can actually feel the serenity. Great shot to meet the challenge.</td>', 'I can actually feel the serenity. Great shot to meet the challenge.', '2009-09-16 17:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650175, 820245, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the overall setup and idea. Something about the angle, particularly on the four, doesn''t feel quite right to me. Also the color of the indoor lighting is unflattering.<br/> <br/>What really works here is the story though I think the title might be trying a bit too hard, perhaps "Go!" would have been more subtle.</td>', 'I like the overall setup and idea. Something about the angle, particularly on the four, doesn''t feel quite right to me. Also the color of the indoor lighting is unflattering. What really works here is the story though I think the title might be trying a bit too hard, perhaps "Go!" would have been more subtle.', '2009-09-16 17:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650177, 821125, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know what I''m looking at and the subject doesn''t really hold my interest.</td>', 'I don''t really know what I''m looking at and the subject doesn''t really hold my interest.', '2009-09-16 17:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650180, 821394, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand the connection to the challenge...</td>', 'I don''t really understand the connection to the challenge...', '2009-09-16 17:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650186, 821542, 3554, '<td valign="top">The lighting has a flat feel to me in this shot. A backlight might have helped the flower to stand out and feel more alive giving better contrast between the live and dead petals... I like the placement of the vase and live flower in the frame.</td>', 'The lighting has a flat feel to me in this shot. A backlight might have helped the flower to stand out and feel more alive giving better contrast between the live and dead petals... I like the placement of the vase and live flower in the frame.', '2009-09-16 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650189, 821596, 3554, '<td valign="top">The sky has digital artifacts that are distracting and I don''t understand the point of having the cactus in the shot - I like the bright blue coloring of the sky - it grabs attention.</td>', 'The sky has digital artifacts that are distracting and I don''t understand the point of having the cactus in the shot - I like the bright blue coloring of the sky - it grabs attention.', '2009-09-16 17:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650194, 820866, 3554, '<td valign="top">I personally find the muted color of the flowers to detract from the shot. Perhaps if there was more contrast between the flowers and the background it would work better (but hard to do with basic editing rules). The daisy in the far left corner which is smaller and more closed seems to unbalance the shot a bit for me, as does the button on the background material.</td>', 'I personally find the muted color of the flowers to detract from the shot. Perhaps if there was more contrast between the flowers and the background it would work better (but hard to do with basic editing rules). The daisy in the far left corner which is smaller and more closed seems to unbalance the shot a bit for me, as does the button on the background material.', '2009-09-16 17:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650197, 821617, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what this has to do with 9.</td>', 'I don''t understand what this has to do with 9.', '2009-09-16 17:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650223, 820451, 105805, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge and bonus point for using the word "plethora" in the title :)</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge and bonus point for using the word "plethora" in the title :)', '2009-09-16 17:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650233, 821435, 105805, '<td valign="top">Funny stuff.  Love the shadow.</td>', 'Funny stuff.  Love the shadow.', '2009-09-16 17:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650235, 821229, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, but I''m having a really hard time deriving any relevance to "9" from it. Am I being blind, or dumb? Feel free to PM me on this :-)</td>', 'Lovely image, but I''m having a really hard time deriving any relevance to "9" from it. Am I being blind, or dumb? Feel free to PM me on this :-)', '2009-09-16 17:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650265, 821394, 88247, '<td valign="top">Bitter-Sweet ''9''...!?<br/> <br/>Looked at this and thought DNMC lol,then realised how very clever this shot is!!:-)</td>', 'Bitter-Sweet ''9''...!? Looked at this and thought DNMC lol,then realised how very clever this shot is!!:-)', '2009-09-16 18:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650305, 821617, 83544, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I can understand this photo, also the title</td>', 'I''m not sure if I can understand this photo, also the title', '2009-09-16 18:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650307, 821455, 83544, '<td valign="top">the border of the dominoes can be barely seen because of the white background, anyway perfect quality and idea in this photo</td>', 'the border of the dominoes can be barely seen because of the white background, anyway perfect quality and idea in this photo', '2009-09-16 18:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650312, 821506, 83544, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the harsh edit in this photo</td>', 'I don''t like the harsh edit in this photo', '2009-09-16 18:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650316, 821229, 83544, '<td valign="top">definetely this is one of my favourites on this contest cuz rhe 9 isn''t so obvious, not to mention the quality and beaty of this photo. Maybe you should have intitled it "Find the 9" so the viewers to see where you are aiming at and not to give you a low vote, anyway you''ve got 10 from me</td>', 'definetely this is one of my favourites on this contest cuz rhe 9 isn''t so obvious, not to mention the quality and beaty of this photo. Maybe you should have intitled it "Find the 9" so the viewers to see where you are aiming at and not to give you a low vote, anyway you''ve got 10 from me', '2009-09-16 18:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650334, 821229, 88247, '<td valign="top">I actually think this is a "Gem" of a shot!!<br/> <br/>Pearl-Gem of the planet moon.(Ask jeeves)lol<br/>Pearl is a good gem stone for the Aries ascendant as Moon rules over the 4th... <br/>Wonder who''s birthday is on the 9th of the 4th!!!<br/> <br/>Lots of signs in this shot,a hole in 1 me thinks,which makes it 1-1:-)XX</td>', 'I actually think this is a "Gem" of a shot!! Pearl-Gem of the planet moon.(Ask jeeves)lolPearl is a good gem stone for the Aries ascendant as Moon rules over the 4th... Wonder who''s birthday is on the 9th of the 4th!!! Lots of signs in this shot,a hole in 1 me thinks,which makes it 1-1:-)XX', '2009-09-16 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650361, 821454, 83544, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for 9, the frame is well applied and it fits well with the color of the cat, the cat''s eyes are little blurry but it''s still a nice shot, 8</td>', 'Nice idea for 9, the frame is well applied and it fits well with the color of the cat, the cat''s eyes are little blurry but it''s still a nice shot, 8', '2009-09-16 20:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650365, 821106, 109931, '<td valign="top">simple and nicely done...I do like a little salt with my eggs. Cheers</td>', 'simple and nicely done...I do like a little salt with my eggs. Cheers', '2009-09-16 20:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650366, 821451, 109931, '<td valign="top">nice job great colors</td>', 'nice job great colors', '2009-09-16 20:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650389, 821596, 106374, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful picture..I love the lighting and color, but it just doesn''t say 9 to me at all. Wonderful pic though!</td>', 'Very beautiful picture..I love the lighting and color, but it just doesn''t say 9 to me at all. Wonderful pic though!', '2009-09-16 20:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650391, 821507, 106374, '<td valign="top">Someone else had the same idea, but both of you had wonderful ways of shooting it! Great picture!</td>', 'Someone else had the same idea, but both of you had wonderful ways of shooting it! Great picture!', '2009-09-16 20:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650397, 821617, 106374, '<td valign="top">Love the ride &amp; the pictures pretty good, too..but..what? Where''s the 9?</td>', 'Love the ride & the pictures pretty good, too..but..what? Where''s the 9?', '2009-09-16 20:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650422, 821423, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is cute and well photographed.</td>', 'This is cute and well photographed.', '2009-09-16 21:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650423, 821592, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice and interesting, great colours, good exposure to pick up on the available lighting.</td>', 'Very nice and interesting, great colours, good exposure to pick up on the available lighting.', '2009-09-16 21:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650502, 821423, 81362, '<td valign="top">Fun design (whatever that red stuff is). The blueberries add just the right contrast -- nice way to break up the pale outer 1/3 of the cereal/milk.</td>', 'Fun design (whatever that red stuff is). The blueberries add just the right contrast -- nice way to break up the pale outer 1/3 of the cereal/milk.', '2009-09-16 21:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650507, 820933, 81362, '<td valign="top">Shape of the numeral is pretty subtle. Slight shift or crop to eliminate the bits of pink petals on the left would help me stay with the central shapes easier.</td>', 'Shape of the numeral is pretty subtle. Slight shift or crop to eliminate the bits of pink petals on the left would help me stay with the central shapes easier.', '2009-09-16 21:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650510, 821543, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nicely disorienting. Could be gymnast ready to do a handspring or cartwheel. Or maybe it is shadow puppet time. I like the hair giving a sense of motion.</td>', 'Nicely disorienting. Could be gymnast ready to do a handspring or cartwheel. Or maybe it is shadow puppet time. I like the hair giving a sense of motion.', '2009-09-16 21:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650514, 821476, 81362, '<td valign="top">Clean lighting goes well with the modern technology design of the wristwatch.</td>', 'Clean lighting goes well with the modern technology design of the wristwatch.', '2009-09-16 21:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650517, 821354, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good trick getting the steering wheel to stick there at the proper position. Red glow underneath gives it a sense of energy.</td>', 'Good trick getting the steering wheel to stick there at the proper position. Red glow underneath gives it a sense of energy.', '2009-09-16 21:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650534, 821570, 81362, '<td valign="top">Simple curved numeral, but the bright lighting and harsh shadows take away from the main subject. Hard to give specific advice without knowing the constraints you had to deal with.</td>', 'Simple curved numeral, but the bright lighting and harsh shadows take away from the main subject. Hard to give specific advice without knowing the constraints you had to deal with.', '2009-09-16 21:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650539, 821598, 81362, '<td valign="top">It is fun speculating ahead of the challenge about likely subjects and then seeing them show up as predicted. I wonder how this would look with the foreground balls all darker colors to make the 9 ball more dramatic.</td>', 'It is fun speculating ahead of the challenge about likely subjects and then seeing them show up as predicted. I wonder how this would look with the foreground balls all darker colors to make the 9 ball more dramatic.', '2009-09-16 22:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650543, 821528, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice light, framing, and b/w conversion.</td>', 'Nice light, framing, and b/w conversion.', '2009-09-16 22:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650546, 820523, 81362, '<td valign="top">Clever approach to having the lines sag. Love the 9 that got off the paper.</td>', 'Clever approach to having the lines sag. Love the 9 that got off the paper.', '2009-09-16 22:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650615, 821602, 36065, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept with an even more interesting story I am sure.  The crop feels too tight, especially on the left side with the hand touching the frame.  The white balance also seems too warm for the capture leaving the skin tones overly orange.  i think that this idea had some potential, but as it is presented, it just has the appearance of a snapshot.  As it is shot, I give it a 4.</td>', 'An interesting concept with an even more interesting story I am sure.  The crop feels too tight, especially on the left side with the hand touching the frame.  The white balance also seems too warm for the capture leaving the skin tones overly orange.  i think that this idea had some potential, but as it is presented, it just has the appearance of a snapshot.  As it is shot, I give it a 4.', '2009-09-16 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650623, 821592, 36065, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors you captured here.  I would, however, like to see this one with a different composition.  Don''t get me wrong, I do like this composition, but I think the 9 is too tight in the corner and that the focal plane should be switched for this particular capture.  I''d just like to see the 9 more prominent in relation to the size of the frame.  Still, I think that this is one of the better images I have seen in this challenge thus far.  From me, a 7.</td>', 'I really like the colors you captured here.  I would, however, like to see this one with a different composition.  Don''t get me wrong, I do like this composition, but I think the 9 is too tight in the corner and that the focal plane should be switched for this particular capture.  I''d just like to see the 9 more prominent in relation to the size of the frame.  Still, I think that this is one of the better images I have seen in this challenge thus far.  From me, a 7.', '2009-09-16 22:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650629, 821398, 36065, '<td valign="top">Selective desaturation can be a very useful tool when executed effectively.  Here, the red of the matchbox seems distorted and out of place.  I to like the idea, but, in my opinion, all nine matchsticks should also be in crisp focus.  With the challenge subject being nine, I''d like to see the nine clearly distinguished in the image.  Here, one item is distinguished, but even that one has some detraction with the red in the matchbox.  Definitely some potential here, but this one needs much better execution to grow your score.  3.</td>', 'Selective desaturation can be a very useful tool when executed effectively.  Here, the red of the matchbox seems distorted and out of place.  I to like the idea, but, in my opinion, all nine matchsticks should also be in crisp focus.  With the challenge subject being nine, I''d like to see the nine clearly distinguished in the image.  Here, one item is distinguished, but even that one has some detraction with the red in the matchbox.  Definitely some potential here, but this one needs much better execution to grow your score.  3.', '2009-09-16 22:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650638, 821423, 36065, '<td valign="top">I do not dislike your capture and creation here, but nothing really jumps  out and grabs my eye to lead it into the frame.  I like the contrast between the blues and reds, but even that seems lost in the mundane look of the milk and cereal.  Creative, but it needs some pop to bring this one up.  From me, a 5.</td>', 'I do not dislike your capture and creation here, but nothing really jumps  out and grabs my eye to lead it into the frame.  I like the contrast between the blues and reds, but even that seems lost in the mundane look of the milk and cereal.  Creative, but it needs some pop to bring this one up.  From me, a 5.', '2009-09-16 22:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650639, 821386, 108687, '<td valign="top">Just too many cats in the challenge.</td>', 'Just too many cats in the challenge.', '2009-09-16 22:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650642, 821429, 108687, '<td valign="top">The composition was off for me.</td>', 'The composition was off for me.', '2009-09-16 22:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650672, 821394, 36065, '<td valign="top">The selective focus works well in your image, but the 9 is very difficult to see right away.  I like the muted tones you captured, but the narrow, rectangle crop gives this one an awkward appearance.  In addition, it is cropped too much in from the right hand side, nearly touching the lemon.  A neat still life, but this one is a definite challenge shoehorn.  Even still, with a better crop I wouldn''t have hesitated to give it a strong score.  As it is, I score it a 4.</td>', 'The selective focus works well in your image, but the 9 is very difficult to see right away.  I like the muted tones you captured, but the narrow, rectangle crop gives this one an awkward appearance.  In addition, it is cropped too much in from the right hand side, nearly touching the lemon.  A neat still life, but this one is a definite challenge shoehorn.  Even still, with a better crop I wouldn''t have hesitated to give it a strong score.  As it is, I score it a 4.', '2009-09-16 22:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650677, 821617, 36065, '<td valign="top">I am guessing that I am not the first voter to struggle to find the relation of this image to the Nine challenge.  I don''t even know what else to comment.  1.</td>', 'I am guessing that I am not the first voter to struggle to find the relation of this image to the Nine challenge.  I don''t even know what else to comment.  1.', '2009-09-16 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650699, 821446, 36065, '<td valign="top">This is a very, very common subject and technique on DPC that is often well-executed.  This one is lacking in the fact that the sixes are much more prominent in the image than your nines, even though the wonderfully, crisp focus is right where it needs to be.  I think a tighter crop would have better accentuated the proper portion of the image.  As it is, the background competes far too much with the subject.  For the crisp focus and excellent detail, I score this one a 5.  Even though this has become one of my least favorite techniques on this site, with a tighter crop I would have scored this one stronger.</td>', 'This is a very, very common subject and technique on DPC that is often well-executed.  This one is lacking in the fact that the sixes are much more prominent in the image than your nines, even though the wonderfully, crisp focus is right where it needs to be.  I think a tighter crop would have better accentuated the proper portion of the image.  As it is, the background competes far too much with the subject.  For the crisp focus and excellent detail, I score this one a 5.  Even though this has become one of my least favorite techniques on this site, with a tighter crop I would have scored this one stronger.', '2009-09-16 23:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650708, 821269, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of subject here.  I have seen several mundane clock photos in this challenge thus far, but yours has a much higher level of interest and creativity.  I would, however, like to see this with a better composition.  As it is, if feels too centered and unbalance.  Odd, I know, but that''s what my mind is telling me.  I think shooting with about a 20 degree counter-clockwise composition would have given this one a better flow.  The imbalance between the chopped face cover on the left and the dead space on the bottom right corner is a bit too much for my eye to overcome.  Nicely creative, but I''d like to see a bit better execution.  This one scores a 6 from my vote.</td>', 'I like your choice of subject here.  I have seen several mundane clock photos in this challenge thus far, but yours has a much higher level of interest and creativity.  I would, however, like to see this with a better composition.  As it is, if feels too centered and unbalance.  Odd, I know, but that''s what my mind is telling me.  I think shooting with about a 20 degree counter-clockwise composition would have given this one a better flow.  The imbalance between the chopped face cover on the left and the dead space on the bottom right corner is a bit too much for my eye to overcome.  Nicely creative, but I''d like to see a bit better execution.  This one scores a 6 from my vote.', '2009-09-16 23:11:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5650726, 821460, 36065, '<td valign="top">You tackled a pretty difficult subject here.  Shooting distant whites on several different focal planes along with harsh, uneven lighting is difficult to pull off with any appeal.  As it is shot, you lose too much of your intended subjects to poor lighting, fading focus, and simple obstructions.  You did fit well into the challenge topic, but this one needs more attention to execution from the composition and shutter release.  3.</td>', 'You tackled a pretty difficult subject here.  Shooting distant whites on several different focal planes along with harsh, uneven lighting is difficult to pull off with any appeal.  As it is shot, you lose too much of your intended subjects to poor lighting, fading focus, and simple obstructions.  You did fit well into the challenge topic, but this one needs more attention to execution from the composition and shutter release.  3.', '2009-09-16 23:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650740, 821239, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, but your primary focus is off.  Just glancing at the image and assuming a challenge topic, I would go with fractions before I would guess nine.  Sure, the nine is prominent is size, but the soft focus leads the eye away from your intended topic and locks it onto the 7/8.  I do like the composition, but the nine absolutely needs to be the primary focal point of the image.  5.</td>', 'Nice macro, but your primary focus is off.  Just glancing at the image and assuming a challenge topic, I would go with fractions before I would guess nine.  Sure, the nine is prominent is size, but the soft focus leads the eye away from your intended topic and locks it onto the 7/8.  I do like the composition, but the nine absolutely needs to be the primary focal point of the image.  5.', '2009-09-16 23:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650762, 821338, 36065, '<td valign="top">I am about 30% of the way through voting on the images for this challenge, but I am already sure that this one will ribbon.  I imagine that you are sitting on a score somewhere in the 6.75 range right now.  Great colors and wonderful creativity.  I am seeing some pixelation with some of the petals, but I don''t think that it will be enough to significantly detract from your score.  From me, a 7.</td>', 'I am about 30% of the way through voting on the images for this challenge, but I am already sure that this one will ribbon.  I imagine that you are sitting on a score somewhere in the 6.75 range right now.  Great colors and wonderful creativity.  I am seeing some pixelation with some of the petals, but I don''t think that it will be enough to significantly detract from your score.  From me, a 7.', '2009-09-16 23:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
