(5650905, 820866, 60581, '<td valign="top">It looks like you tried to put lights from the bottom to give some dynamic effect but I think a reflector from top would helped you to not have dark flower but a bit boosted light from bottom and reflection from top.</td>', 'It looks like you tried to put lights from the bottom to give some dynamic effect but I think a reflector from top would helped you to not have dark flower but a bit boosted light from bottom and reflection from top.', '2009-09-17 00:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650918, 820883, 36065, '<td valign="top">You have the composition and elements of a wonderful photograph here.  The only thing missing is lighting and contrast.  I like the title and how it actually contrasts with the idea that first pops in my mind when I look at the capture.  At first glance, this is a bowl full of fruit.  Then with some concentration you really do see that it is just a meager harvest.  Well seen and composed, but the lighting is flat and a bit underexposed for my taste.  I score it a 5 as is, but this one is full of potential.</td>', 'You have the composition and elements of a wonderful photograph here.  The only thing missing is lighting and contrast.  I like the title and how it actually contrasts with the idea that first pops in my mind when I look at the capture.  At first glance, this is a bowl full of fruit.  Then with some concentration you really do see that it is just a meager harvest.  Well seen and composed, but the lighting is flat and a bit underexposed for my taste.  I score it a 5 as is, but this one is full of potential.', '2009-09-17 00:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650949, 820600, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, bu the execution seems to be a bit lacking.  The shallow depth of field works well for the image, but the muted colors detract from the pop and sparkle that the image should/could have.  Your border also takes away from the overall quality of the presentation.  I like a clean, thick, white border with a small, 1-2 px back line separating the image from the white border.  That''s all a matter of personal preference, but a clean look would have served this one much better.  I like the square, centered composition.  It plays nicely with the symmetry of the subject.  I am going to go 5 here, but there is tons of room to grow this vote.</td>', 'I like the idea, bu the execution seems to be a bit lacking.  The shallow depth of field works well for the image, but the muted colors detract from the pop and sparkle that the image should/could have.  Your border also takes away from the overall quality of the presentation.  I like a clean, thick, white border with a small, 1-2 px back line separating the image from the white border.  That''s all a matter of personal preference, but a clean look would have served this one much better.  I like the square, centered composition.  It plays nicely with the symmetry of the subject.  I am going to go 5 here, but there is tons of room to grow this vote.', '2009-09-17 00:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650950, 821601, 36065, '<td valign="top">Interesting silhouette.  Great, transitioning and complimenting complementing colors in your sunset.  I think that I''d like to see it even a bit more offset in the crop. 5.</td>', 'Interesting silhouette.  Great, transitioning and complimenting complementing colors in your sunset.  I think that I''d like to see it even a bit more offset in the crop. 5.', '2009-09-17 00:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
