(5652277, 821547, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like how clean and simple this shot is.</td>', 'I like how clean and simple this shot is.', '2009-09-18 04:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652278, 821581, 3554, '<td valign="top">In my top five this challenge - The title brings it all together.</td>', 'In my top five this challenge - The title brings it all together.', '2009-09-18 04:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652280, 820451, 3554, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, especially the people going into the station. The shirt of the lady looking into the camera seems over exposed and I wish the guy with his back to us (the one talking to the ladies) was either at a different angle or off to the side more - my eye keeps landing on his butt lol.<br/> <br/>In some ways I think this was a hard challenge to meet with 9 being an integral part of the story but you definitely nailed that part of the challenge. Nicely done!</td>', 'I love the composition, especially the people going into the station. The shirt of the lady looking into the camera seems over exposed and I wish the guy with his back to us (the one talking to the ladies) was either at a different angle or off to the side more - my eye keeps landing on his butt lol. In some ways I think this was a hard challenge to meet with 9 being an integral part of the story but you definitely nailed that part of the challenge. Nicely done!', '2009-09-18 04:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652281, 821451, 3554, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and gentle lighting in this one.</td>', 'Love the colors and gentle lighting in this one.', '2009-09-18 04:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652282, 821399, 3554, '<td valign="top">I love the calmness I feel when I look at this shot. I think the muted color, the reflections, and the way the sky and water blend together communicate stillness and mystery. One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'I love the calmness I feel when I look at this shot. I think the muted color, the reflections, and the way the sky and water blend together communicate stillness and mystery. One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2009-09-18 04:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652283, 821424, 3554, '<td valign="top">Love the color and lighting in this one.</td>', 'Love the color and lighting in this one.', '2009-09-18 04:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652284, 821592, 3554, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and really uses the 9 as a major element in the picture''s story. Well done.</td>', 'Love the colors and really uses the 9 as a major element in the picture''s story. Well done.', '2009-09-18 04:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652285, 821397, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections and how your choice of lighting gives depth. The subject is a bit unoriginal.</td>', 'I like the reflections and how your choice of lighting gives depth. The subject is a bit unoriginal.', '2009-09-18 04:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652286, 821435, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like it overall but the 9 might be a little too understated at the top.</td>', 'I like it overall but the 9 might be a little too understated at the top.', '2009-09-18 04:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652287, 821511, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty quality of this shot - it tells something about the location of the phone without having to show anything else. I can picture this phone on a busy city street corner or inside a prison.</td>', 'I like the gritty quality of this shot - it tells something about the location of the phone without having to show anything else. I can picture this phone on a busy city street corner or inside a prison.', '2009-09-18 04:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652288, 821577, 3554, '<td valign="top">The nine is important to the story of this shot which I really like. I might have simplified the title to "Wild Bill Hickok''s last hand" to let the picture do more of the story telling.</td>', 'The nine is important to the story of this shot which I really like. I might have simplified the title to "Wild Bill Hickok''s last hand" to let the picture do more of the story telling.', '2009-09-18 04:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652289, 821228, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the use of perspective in this shot and that it tells a clear story. Well done.</td>', 'I like the use of perspective in this shot and that it tells a clear story. Well done.', '2009-09-18 04:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652290, 821487, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like how you see different parts of all the people. This picture does a nice job of helping me feel like I''m there and that this is a busy street with lots of activity. I keep coming back and looking at this one.</td>', 'I really like how you see different parts of all the people. This picture does a nice job of helping me feel like I''m there and that this is a busy street with lots of activity. I keep coming back and looking at this one.', '2009-09-18 04:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652291, 821612, 3554, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped out some of the clouds at top - leaving enough to show the clouds are there but making the lightning even more prominent.</td>', 'I might have cropped out some of the clouds at top - leaving enough to show the clouds are there but making the lightning even more prominent.', '2009-09-18 04:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652292, 821219, 3554, '<td valign="top">A nice clean shot - simple but effective.</td>', 'A nice clean shot - simple but effective.', '2009-09-18 04:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652293, 821477, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot - it''s got a nice balance of vertical and horizontal lines. I''m not a big fan of the overall color cast and the plate seems over exposed. The reflection on the right 9 is a distraction.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot - it''s got a nice balance of vertical and horizontal lines. I''m not a big fan of the overall color cast and the plate seems over exposed. The reflection on the right 9 is a distraction.', '2009-09-18 04:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652294, 821476, 3554, '<td valign="top">Pretty decent product shot - the lightning/reflection on the dial with the numbers that go from 05-60 (I can''t think of what that''s called) is great from 20-40 but then from 45-15 it''s not as clean. You also lose some detail on the knob (to the right of the 15).<br/> <br/>The background is nice and clean and I like the silver on white combo.</td>', 'Pretty decent product shot - the lightning/reflection on the dial with the numbers that go from 05-60 (I can''t think of what that''s called) is great from 20-40 but then from 45-15 it''s not as clean. You also lose some detail on the knob (to the right of the 15). The background is nice and clean and I like the silver on white combo.', '2009-09-18 04:57:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5652295, 821507, 3554, '<td valign="top">The rust color in the background is particularly effective in helping the viewer understand the environment. I tend to think of clothespins as existing in the country - I like the contrast to that assumption in this shot.</td>', 'The rust color in the background is particularly effective in helping the viewer understand the environment. I tend to think of clothespins as existing in the country - I like the contrast to that assumption in this shot.', '2009-09-18 04:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652296, 821505, 3554, '<td valign="top">A nice, clean, simple shot. I like the border for this one.</td>', 'A nice, clean, simple shot. I like the border for this one.', '2009-09-18 04:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652297, 821354, 3554, '<td valign="top">Cute! The artifacts in the top corners (under the border) are unfortunate.</td>', 'Cute! The artifacts in the top corners (under the border) are unfortunate.', '2009-09-18 04:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652298, 821069, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like how the 9 horse is prominently placed in the frame and I think the use of desaturation was effective here.</td>', 'I like how the 9 horse is prominently placed in the frame and I think the use of desaturation was effective here.', '2009-09-18 04:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652299, 821645, 3554, '<td valign="top">For some reason the cropping under the center line bugs me - it''s like I instinctively know the card isn''t the right dimensions. I like that BINGO at top is slightly out of focus so that the part that is in focus is where the real action is.</td>', 'For some reason the cropping under the center line bugs me - it''s like I instinctively know the card isn''t the right dimensions. I like that BINGO at top is slightly out of focus so that the part that is in focus is where the real action is.', '2009-09-18 04:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652300, 821328, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think if you had cropped some of the water off the bottom it would lead the eye more readily to the lights in the sky.  I like the contrast in the sky of the redish light with the blue lights.</td>', 'I think if you had cropped some of the water off the bottom it would lead the eye more readily to the lights in the sky.  I like the contrast in the sky of the redish light with the blue lights.', '2009-09-18 04:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652302, 821338, 3554, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and contrast of the bright orange/yellow on black. I''m not crazy about the border.</td>', 'Love the colors and contrast of the bright orange/yellow on black. I''m not crazy about the border.', '2009-09-18 04:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652303, 821520, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the magnifying glass to add interest - I wish the color cast of the shot was less yellow though.</td>', 'I like the use of the magnifying glass to add interest - I wish the color cast of the shot was less yellow though.', '2009-09-18 04:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652304, 821564, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the use of natural lighting in this shot.</td>', 'I like the use of natural lighting in this shot.', '2009-09-18 05:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652305, 820324, 3554, '<td valign="top">Gave me a chuckle - good concept and I like the composition. Wish the slug was in better focus or positioned differently or something.</td>', 'Gave me a chuckle - good concept and I like the composition. Wish the slug was in better focus or positioned differently or something.', '2009-09-18 05:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652306, 821001, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting and it has an anthropomorphic feel to it - kind of reminds me of a mother watching one of her kids leave the nest.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting and it has an anthropomorphic feel to it - kind of reminds me of a mother watching one of her kids leave the nest.', '2009-09-18 05:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652307, 820738, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like your use of DoF to truly isolate the 9 - there''s nowhere else for my eye to really land.</td>', 'I like your use of DoF to truly isolate the 9 - there''s nowhere else for my eye to really land.', '2009-09-18 05:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652308, 821569, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand the purpose of the bug in this picture...</td>', 'I don''t really understand the purpose of the bug in this picture...', '2009-09-18 05:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652309, 821607, 3554, '<td valign="top">The shirt and left arm seem a little over exposed but I really like the positioning of the girl and how it''s like she''s reaching back in time as she touches the names of those that (presumably) fought and died to protect her way of life - connecting her to people who never knew her and she would never know.</td>', 'The shirt and left arm seem a little over exposed but I really like the positioning of the girl and how it''s like she''s reaching back in time as she touches the names of those that (presumably) fought and died to protect her way of life - connecting her to people who never knew her and she would never know.', '2009-09-18 05:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652310, 821472, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of DoF here except that I wish all 9 snacks were in focus.</td>', 'I really like the use of DoF here except that I wish all 9 snacks were in focus.', '2009-09-18 05:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652311, 820851, 3554, '<td valign="top">For some reason my eye naturally lands on the no. 10 horse and I sort of have to force myself to look at the number 9 horse who is the intended subject. Good choice of subject for the challenge and a solid shot.</td>', 'For some reason my eye naturally lands on the no. 10 horse and I sort of have to force myself to look at the number 9 horse who is the intended subject. Good choice of subject for the challenge and a solid shot.', '2009-09-18 05:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652312, 821506, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like how ominous this feels.</td>', 'I like how ominous this feels.', '2009-09-18 05:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652313, 821398, 3554, '<td valign="top">I''m usually a big fan of shallow DoF but the two matches to the right of the unlit one are a little too in focus for the extreme oof match on the far left to work well together. I think if all the matches except the red one were more oof it would have worked better - if that makes sense. <br/> <br/>I like the overall idea, colors, and lighting.</td>', 'I''m usually a big fan of shallow DoF but the two matches to the right of the unlit one are a little too in focus for the extreme oof match on the far left to work well together. I think if all the matches except the red one were more oof it would have worked better - if that makes sense.  I like the overall idea, colors, and lighting.', '2009-09-18 05:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
