(5652553, 821456, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great background and warm tones.. flowers in the foreground add just enough to create the perfect mood! <br/> <br/>Meets the challenge :  3/3<br/>Execution : 1/2 - Iron railings (main subject of your picture) look a little soft, while it stands out very well with the DOF, on the top the dark background and dark railings are making it lost! <br/>Originality : 2/2<br/>and everything else : 1/3<br/>total : 7/10</td>', 'Great background and warm tones.. flowers in the foreground add just enough to create the perfect mood!  Meets the challenge :  3/3Execution : 1/2 - Iron railings (main subject of your picture) look a little soft, while it stands out very well with the DOF, on the top the dark background and dark railings are making it lost! Originality : 2/2and everything else : 1/3total : 7/10', '2009-09-18 12:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652563, 821528, 42256, '<td valign="top">One of the better pregnancy shots.  Peace sign - Is that a real tattoo? Her expression is beautiful as well!<br/>Meets the challenge :  3/3<br/>Execution : 1/2 [Crop is too tight. Shot is not sharp enough..you can see the motion blur on her lips and hands.  It was a great idea to convert it to B&amp;W but its lacking contrast that can really make a difference!]<br/>Originality : 2/2<br/>and everything else : 0/3<br/>total : 6/10</td>', 'One of the better pregnancy shots.  Peace sign - Is that a real tattoo? Her expression is beautiful as well!Meets the challenge :  3/3Execution : 1/2 [Crop is too tight. Shot is not sharp enough..you can see the motion blur on her lips and hands.  It was a great idea to convert it to B&W but its lacking contrast that can really make a difference!]Originality : 2/2and everything else : 0/3total : 6/10', '2009-09-18 12:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
