(5653558, 821617, 48389, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I can''t see how this is connected to 9 at all, maybe I am missing something really obvious? The pinks/reds work well against the blue and the image is nice and sharp, but, for me this DNMC sorry.</td>', 'I''m afraid I can''t see how this is connected to 9 at all, maybe I am missing something really obvious? The pinks/reds work well against the blue and the image is nice and sharp, but, for me this DNMC sorry.', '2009-09-19 11:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653559, 820649, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in the 9 but I am finding the background quite distracting at the bottom of the frame and I can''t work out whether this is in focus or not.</td>', 'Nice colours in the 9 but I am finding the background quite distracting at the bottom of the frame and I can''t work out whether this is in focus or not.', '2009-09-19 11:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653560, 821429, 48389, '<td valign="top">I''m unsure whether there is actually a 9in this shot? Also, your title suggests it was a lovely day outside which leads me to thinking you were out with your camera but this shot doesn''t look like it was taken outside?</td>', 'I''m unsure whether there is actually a 9in this shot? Also, your title suggests it was a lovely day outside which leads me to thinking you were out with your camera but this shot doesn''t look like it was taken outside?', '2009-09-19 11:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653561, 820545, 48389, '<td valign="top">The background is extremely distracting here and it would have been better if the coins were completely in focus. This is just MHO.</td>', 'The background is extremely distracting here and it would have been better if the coins were completely in focus. This is just MHO.', '2009-09-19 11:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653562, 821548, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrant colours here but feel the composition isn''t right, the image is far too busy. This is just MHO.</td>', 'I like the vibrant colours here but feel the composition isn''t right, the image is far too busy. This is just MHO.', '2009-09-19 11:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653586, 821475, 36065, '<td valign="top">You have definitely captured an interesting subject here, but I think that the depth of field detracts from the overall image.  While some have successfully escaped the thought in my mind, I still believe that a challenge titled Nine with nine individual subjects in the image should keep those subjects in crisp focus throughout.  Of course that is not a hard, fast rule, rather a thought inside my mind''s eye.  I think that crisp focus would have helped your image more.  As I move my eye through the frame and to the right, it becomes more difficult to look at due to the loss of focus.  Sure, the blurring does force my eye to stay on a certain portion of the image, but I''d rather it be free to wander within the constraints of the frame.  Interesting image, but I think more focal clarity would have served well to grow your score.  From me, a score of 6.</td>', 'You have definitely captured an interesting subject here, but I think that the depth of field detracts from the overall image.  While some have successfully escaped the thought in my mind, I still believe that a challenge titled Nine with nine individual subjects in the image should keep those subjects in crisp focus throughout.  Of course that is not a hard, fast rule, rather a thought inside my mind''s eye.  I think that crisp focus would have helped your image more.  As I move my eye through the frame and to the right, it becomes more difficult to look at due to the loss of focus.  Sure, the blurring does force my eye to stay on a certain portion of the image, but I''d rather it be free to wander within the constraints of the frame.  Interesting image, but I think more focal clarity would have served well to grow your score.  From me, a score of 6.', '2009-09-19 11:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
