(5654950, 821399, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very smooth water with perfect reflections (assume long exposure) contribute to a hauning kind of beauty. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very smooth water with perfect reflections (assume long exposure) contribute to a hauning kind of beauty. Nicely done.', '2009-09-20 23:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654953, 821557, 81362, '<td valign="top">The term "Equity" on the clock serves as a reminder that we all have the same amount of time. Harsh reflection near the 9 may reduce the score.</td>', 'The term "Equity" on the clock serves as a reminder that we all have the same amount of time. Harsh reflection near the 9 may reduce the score.', '2009-09-20 23:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654954, 820863, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and good version of 9''s. A background without texture and either very dark or at least with color tones less similar to the clothespins might have boosted this to the nine or ten level.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and good version of 9''s. A background without texture and either very dark or at least with color tones less similar to the clothespins might have boosted this to the nine or ten level.', '2009-09-20 23:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654963, 821544, 81362, '<td valign="top">Living in the dark perhaps makes this a negative nine. Subtle to the extent that many may miss it. The bit of orange red glow along the left edge adds a lot.</td>', 'Living in the dark perhaps makes this a negative nine. Subtle to the extent that many may miss it. The bit of orange red glow along the left edge adds a lot.', '2009-09-20 23:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654968, 821394, 81362, '<td valign="top">I lkie the texture and colors of the rose. Although used for the "nine" configuration, the orange is the weak part of the composition.</td>', 'I lkie the texture and colors of the rose. Although used for the "nine" configuration, the orange is the weak part of the composition.', '2009-09-20 23:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654974, 821612, 81362, '<td valign="top">Impressive set of bolts, even if getting to "nine" is a little subjective.</td>', 'Impressive set of bolts, even if getting to "nine" is a little subjective.', '2009-09-20 23:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654994, 821563, 81362, '<td valign="top">The building looks like it presents a lot of photographic opportunities beyond this challenge. I suppose the brisk wind expalins why the seats were empty. The grouping of chairs makes the two on the right seem disconnected from the others, but I''m not sure whether a change in positon or just moving the chairs closer in would work any better.</td>', 'The building looks like it presents a lot of photographic opportunities beyond this challenge. I suppose the brisk wind expalins why the seats were empty. The grouping of chairs makes the two on the right seem disconnected from the others, but I''m not sure whether a change in positon or just moving the chairs closer in would work any better.', '2009-09-20 23:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655001, 821139, 81362, '<td valign="top">To my eyes (not well trained in observing sports gear) the nine is subtle. Strong light on face and knee present quite an exposure challenge. I wonder if a reflector (or light colored beach towel) aimed at the back of the clothing might have allowed a notch or two lower exposure value for the side facing the light (not that such set ups are always an option).</td>', 'To my eyes (not well trained in observing sports gear) the nine is subtle. Strong light on face and knee present quite an exposure challenge. I wonder if a reflector (or light colored beach towel) aimed at the back of the clothing might have allowed a notch or two lower exposure value for the side facing the light (not that such set ups are always an option).', '2009-09-20 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655003, 821555, 81362, '<td valign="top">Psychologists could add this to their set of Rorschach test images. Lots of interpretations beyond the font. I would have missed the image being the letter "i" if not for the title.</td>', 'Psychologists could add this to their set of Rorschach test images. Lots of interpretations beyond the font. I would have missed the image being the letter "i" if not for the title.', '2009-09-20 23:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655005, 821397, 81362, '<td valign="top">The shadows are a nice bonus, not often seen in reflection shots.</td>', 'The shadows are a nice bonus, not often seen in reflection shots.', '2009-09-20 23:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655010, 821275, 81362, '<td valign="top">I suppose kaleidoscope eyes could result from consuming 9 "Buds". I think the curve of green and black in the upper left takes away from the rest of the image - scrolling suggests a slight crop from the top and left to eliminate the pure black part of that curve and reduce the size of the purple area in the lower left would make the nine buds stronger visually.</td>', 'I suppose kaleidoscope eyes could result from consuming 9 "Buds". I think the curve of green and black in the upper left takes away from the rest of the image - scrolling suggests a slight crop from the top and left to eliminate the pure black part of that curve and reduce the size of the purple area in the lower left would make the nine buds stronger visually.', '2009-09-21 00:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655012, 820887, 81362, '<td valign="top">This would be fun in a "T" challenge too. I like images that focus in on commonplace objects. Black/yellow nicely graphic here.</td>', 'This would be fun in a "T" challenge too. I like images that focus in on commonplace objects. Black/yellow nicely graphic here.', '2009-09-21 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655015, 820492, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very well shot.  This would do well as a product ad shot (IMHO).  And yes, I caught the time at 9:00 and 9 seconds on the 9th.  I only wonder why you didn''t shoot the moon and wait nine more minutes...</td>', 'Very well shot.  This would do well as a product ad shot (IMHO).  And yes, I caught the time at 9:00 and 9 seconds on the 9th.  I only wonder why you didn''t shoot the moon and wait nine more minutes...', '2009-09-21 00:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655016, 821435, 33400, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to get it -which makes this a better shot IMO.  Really well done, especially for basic editing.</td>', 'Took me a second to get it -which makes this a better shot IMO.  Really well done, especially for basic editing.', '2009-09-21 00:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655017, 820702, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great flying symmetry on their part, and great capture on your part.  With basic editing, this can''t be selective desat (can it?). So was the sky really this gray?  Looking forward to your notes.</td>', 'Great flying symmetry on their part, and great capture on your part.  With basic editing, this can''t be selective desat (can it?). So was the sky really this gray?  Looking forward to your notes.', '2009-09-21 00:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655018, 820810, 33400, '<td valign="top">Interesting imagery and nice macro.  I like the way you have this lit, except for the little bit of bright spot in the lower right, under the joker card.  Also, I get the (assumed) intentional play on jokers surrounding the nine - or six.  Clever.</td>', 'Interesting imagery and nice macro.  I like the way you have this lit, except for the little bit of bright spot in the lower right, under the joker card.  Also, I get the (assumed) intentional play on jokers surrounding the nine - or six.  Clever.', '2009-09-21 00:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655019, 821459, 33400, '<td valign="top">Although I assume this is a set-up shot, I really like it. I wish you had lit the ball a little more, as it is an integral part of the action.  The black background really works for me.  Nice job.</td>', 'Although I assume this is a set-up shot, I really like it. I wish you had lit the ball a little more, as it is an integral part of the action.  The black background really works for me.  Nice job.', '2009-09-21 00:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655020, 820342, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  This would make an excellent poster for the celebration of, well....9.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'Great shot.  This would make an excellent poster for the celebration of, well....9. Good job.', '2009-09-21 00:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655026, 821251, 81362, '<td valign="top">Square crop is good for this subject and the almost glowing yellow-green stem makes this better than many flower shots. I wonder if rotating to have the stem end closer to a corner (if possible) might make this more dynamic.</td>', 'Square crop is good for this subject and the almost glowing yellow-green stem makes this better than many flower shots. I wonder if rotating to have the stem end closer to a corner (if possible) might make this more dynamic.', '2009-09-21 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
