(5656593, 820702, 81362, '<td valign="top">Thumbnail view: five contrails. Voting view: nine red airplanes - nice visual surprise. Red usually works well with blue, so choice of grey sky is interesting. I think that sets up the small red areas to have much greater impact. Well seen and nicely executed.</td>', 'Thumbnail view: five contrails. Voting view: nine red airplanes - nice visual surprise. Red usually works well with blue, so choice of grey sky is interesting. I think that sets up the small red areas to have much greater impact. Well seen and nicely executed.', '2009-09-21 22:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656599, 821424, 81362, '<td valign="top">Creative set up. Graphic quality is so nice that it makes me wish for a next degree of perfection, maybe keeping the inner cover and page tighter to the other pages and tacking down the feathered pages for more uniformity (tacky glue? - or maybe not...). The colors and shapes inside the loop keep the eye occupied well.</td>', 'Creative set up. Graphic quality is so nice that it makes me wish for a next degree of perfection, maybe keeping the inner cover and page tighter to the other pages and tacking down the feathered pages for more uniformity (tacky glue? - or maybe not...). The colors and shapes inside the loop keep the eye occupied well.', '2009-09-21 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656605, 821626, 81362, '<td valign="top">Lots of drama even if it is not so clear just where the "nine" fits. It took me a while to notice that the large dark critter isn''t a spider. Gradation of greens in background adds interest.</td>', 'Lots of drama even if it is not so clear just where the "nine" fits. It took me a while to notice that the large dark critter isn''t a spider. Gradation of greens in background adds interest.', '2009-09-21 22:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656610, 821576, 81362, '<td valign="top">Fine expression to set this cat apart from other less interesting portraits. Might consider cropping tighter on the right to reduce the expanse of bright background, and maybe a bit from the left for balance and to approach a square crop.</td>', 'Fine expression to set this cat apart from other less interesting portraits. Might consider cropping tighter on the right to reduce the expanse of bright background, and maybe a bit from the left for balance and to approach a square crop.', '2009-09-21 22:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656612, 821391, 81362, '<td valign="top">Design reminds me of a church organ pipe set. Lighting is good both on the matchsticks and the smoke.</td>', 'Design reminds me of a church organ pipe set. Lighting is good both on the matchsticks and the smoke.', '2009-09-21 22:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656643, 821460, 81362, '<td valign="top">During submission time, I added bowling pins to the list of potential topics. Glad to see someone took on the task. Striking (wink) reflections.</td>', 'During submission time, I added bowling pins to the list of potential topics. Glad to see someone took on the task. Striking (wink) reflections.', '2009-09-21 23:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656647, 821606, 81362, '<td valign="top">Composition original. Wish the feathers had just a bit more light to separate from the background better.</td>', 'Composition original. Wish the feathers had just a bit more light to separate from the background better.', '2009-09-21 23:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656653, 821435, 81362, '<td valign="top">Clever and fun image that must have taken some persistence to set up. I''ll look for it among the high scores.</td>', 'Clever and fun image that must have taken some persistence to set up. I''ll look for it among the high scores.', '2009-09-21 23:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656658, 820866, 81362, '<td valign="top">The denim background sparks the imagination with associations with farm life. Refreshing to see daisy''s with light other than bright sunshine.</td>', 'The denim background sparks the imagination with associations with farm life. Refreshing to see daisy''s with light other than bright sunshine.', '2009-09-21 23:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5656660, 821228, 81362, '<td valign="top">Busy composition for busy life. With nine writing spaces available below the title it seems a shame not to have some task on each of them.</td>', 'Busy composition for busy life. With nine writing spaces available below the title it seems a shame not to have some task on each of them.', '2009-09-21 23:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
