(5657844, 820765, 80780, '<td valign="top">Lots of hot spots, but talk about a great idea and a lifesaver. (This comment was made from the bathroom toilet by the way)</td>', 'Lots of hot spots, but talk about a great idea and a lifesaver. (This comment was made from the bathroom toilet by the way)', '2009-09-22 20:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
