(5657851, 821417, 80780, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, although I the front one being a little separated is slightly visually disturbing to me for some reason.</td>', 'Nice set up, although I the front one being a little separated is slightly visually disturbing to me for some reason.', '2009-09-22 20:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
