(5657859, 821599, 80780, '<td valign="top">Oh man. This is a gem! Great shot. I think I know who the top 3 are already and this is one of them!!!</td>', 'Oh man. This is a gem! Great shot. I think I know who the top 3 are already and this is one of them!!!', '2009-09-22 20:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
