(5657883, 820245, 80780, '<td valign="top">Nice use of dice and bringign in some color to it. I would play with this in post to clean it up a bit and make it pop, but for basic I dig it.</td>', 'Nice use of dice and bringign in some color to it. I would play with this in post to clean it up a bit and make it pop, but for basic I dig it.', '2009-09-22 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
