(5658349, 821275, 10275, '<td valign="top">I see what your were trying to do. Nice attempt. Maybe if you put it on tripod, it would have a sharper focus through the faceted lens. The hand shake is probably what spoiled the image. It makes cool rainbow effect on the edges of petals. Keep experimenting with it, you will eventually get a good one out of it.</td>', 'I see what your were trying to do. Nice attempt. Maybe if you put it on tripod, it would have a sharper focus through the faceted lens. The hand shake is probably what spoiled the image. It makes cool rainbow effect on the edges of petals. Keep experimenting with it, you will eventually get a good one out of it.', '2009-09-23 01:20:48.000000', NULL, 0),
