(5658358, 820545, 10275, '<td valign="top">This would be nice from a slightly lower angle. You probably used the macro setting in your C-770UZ, which needs a tripod to be sharp. Also, try it with a softer lighting, so it''s not so reflective. I actually like the background and the coins - it has similar metallic feeling.</td>', 'This would be nice from a slightly lower angle. You probably used the macro setting in your C-770UZ, which needs a tripod to be sharp. Also, try it with a softer lighting, so it''s not so reflective. I actually like the background and the coins - it has similar metallic feeling.', '2009-09-23 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 0),
