(5658651, 821259, 62357, '<td valign="top">Oh what a pity this didn''t score higher.   I guess this totally missed it with the non-UK voters.  If anybody else reads this comment, a 99 is a bit of British thing.  Two chocolate flakes dipped into the ice-cream as shown above.  I guess you got a lot of "did not meet challenge" votes.  Way too subtle for people not in the "know".  (I am a Brit, so got it)</td>', 'Oh what a pity this didn''t score higher.   I guess this totally missed it with the non-UK voters.  If anybody else reads this comment, a 99 is a bit of British thing.  Two chocolate flakes dipped into the ice-cream as shown above.  I guess you got a lot of "did not meet challenge" votes.  Way too subtle for people not in the "know".  (I am a Brit, so got it)', '2009-09-23 04:51:14.000000', NULL, 0),
