(5658848, 821531, 109931, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your feedback and voting. I was not burning incense, but this is how the light from the flashlight showed up in the picture. <br/>As this was my first I will try to get some other shots using the flashlight as a source of light.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for your feedback and voting. I was not burning incense, but this is how the light from the flashlight showed up in the picture. As this was my first I will try to get some other shots using the flashlight as a source of light.', '2009-09-23 09:11:55.000000', NULL, 0),
