(5659382, 820245, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite clever with nine on both the top and front!  (It''s been too long since I''ve dealt with dice to realize you can do that.)  Lighting looks a tad "artificial" (which it probably is) for the DPC crowd, but you did a good job with the setup and presentation.  You may want to try reducing the magenta a bit.  I don''t know what software you use, but with Photoshop it can be done using Selective Color, and that''s legal for basic.</td>', 'Quite clever with nine on both the top and front!  (It''s been too long since I''ve dealt with dice to realize you can do that.)  Lighting looks a tad "artificial" (which it probably is) for the DPC crowd, but you did a good job with the setup and presentation.  You may want to try reducing the magenta a bit.  I don''t know what software you use, but with Photoshop it can be done using Selective Color, and that''s legal for basic.', '2009-09-23 14:44:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5659400, 821219, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep, you haven''t lost a step.  Very nicely done, even with a dirty sensor.</td>', 'Yep, you haven''t lost a step.  Very nicely done, even with a dirty sensor.', '2009-09-23 14:52:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5659482, 821601, 56797, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Soooo close to top ten. I see how it looks kind of tilted at the bottom but ins''t at the top. That''s a weird illusion. Sweet shot though. especially for a time crunch.</td>', 'Nicely done. Soooo close to top ten. I see how it looks kind of tilted at the bottom but ins''t at the top. That''s a weird illusion. Sweet shot though. especially for a time crunch.', '2009-09-23 15:38:35.000000', NULL, 0),
