(5659559, 821592, 67697, '<td valign="top">I am glad to see this finished with a 6+ but I would have expected it to finish higher.  I loved the strong colors and my first thought when I saw this was, for some reason, a TV news station lol.  Gorgeous capture of light Larry!</td>', 'I am glad to see this finished with a 6+ but I would have expected it to finish higher.  I loved the strong colors and my first thought when I saw this was, for some reason, a TV news station lol.  Gorgeous capture of light Larry!', '2009-09-23 16:31:11.000000', NULL, 0),
