(5660235, 821324, 108351, '<td valign="top">From the comments it seems that most of the 9s in the picture were lost on the viewers. I should know after a very few challenges that simpler things are preferred here, but I had been influenced by the "where''s waldo" puzzle aspect of things.<br/> <br/>For those that don''t get the (9) connection: 6 and 3 = 9 facing up on the dice, 5 and 4 = 9 facing the camera on the dice, 9 houses on the properties, 9 dollars shown on one side, and 900 shown on the other side.</td>', 'From the comments it seems that most of the 9s in the picture were lost on the viewers. I should know after a very few challenges that simpler things are preferred here, but I had been influenced by the "where''s waldo" puzzle aspect of things. For those that don''t get the (9) connection: 6 and 3 = 9 facing up on the dice, 5 and 4 = 9 facing the camera on the dice, 9 houses on the properties, 9 dollars shown on one side, and 900 shown on the other side.', '2009-09-24 00:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
