(5660855, 821569, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Magnum_za:</b></div><hr/><i> (Huge flyer here) Judi''s getting <strike>writers</strike> photographers block...? Or she has a copy cat. Nice but not as good as the blue lady bug...which got a 9, this is an 8 due to less DOF and lighting inside the curl.<br/>Now if it is you, you can stop whining about lack of comments! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are mistaken.  I did not whine about lack of comments on this challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by Magnum_za: (Huge flyer here) Judi''s getting writers photographers block...? Or she has a copy cat. Nice but not as good as the blue lady bug...which got a 9, this is an 8 due to less DOF and lighting inside the curl.Now if it is you, you can stop whining about lack of comments!   You are mistaken.  I did not whine about lack of comments on this challenge.', '2009-09-24 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
